{"asset_key":"ep4/quest_story_14106410","episode":"ep4","category":"quest_story","story_id":"14106410","schema_version":1,"lang":"en","texts":{"say:2:1410641001:0":{"text":"Look, a large amount of echorites have been brought here, which means <style=\"highlight\">the temple built for Helthor is nearby</style>.","source_cn":"大量深岩晶被运到这里，说明他们<style=highl...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x538272D35D51C4C8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1410641002:0":{"text":"Speaking of which, compared to the Essail, who always drink the Divine Dew, we dwarves are the smarter ones.","source_cn":"话说回来，与成天喝着恩典灵露的艾塞勒相比，还是我们聪明一点。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x70F2D799728D79BD","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1410641003:0":{"text":"Those who work here have definitely figured out the connection between echorites and the dragon eggs, unlike the clueless Essail.","source_cn":"在这里干活的人都已经发现深岩晶与龙蛋的关系了，不像无知...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xEC874D66B1A03712","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1410641004:0":{"text":"Oh, there's a saying, toplander, you might want to hear.\nDon't point at the coal when your own shoes are covered in soot.","source_cn":"地表人没听过这样的话吗？\\n——煤球别去嘲笑鞋底黑。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD91B1CD2EE713A18","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1410641005:0":{"text":"What?","source_cn":"什么意思？<key:dialog41>","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1C604070E9C87E58","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1410641006:0":{"text":"Aren't you supposed to be the smart one? Bet you'll get it.","source_cn":"你不是自诩聪明？你肯定能想明白。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x418DFAEAA8CF55C0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1410641007:0":{"text":"...You annoying moleminder!","source_cn":"……你这家伙！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2C0DB52F98FBF311","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:祖娅":{"text":"Zanie","source":"祖娅","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:因度厄":{"text":"Indris","source":"因度厄","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":8,"localized_text_count":7,"speaker_count":2}}